{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_07",
  "title": "五省盤",
  "storyCode": "OR-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "05b09173735dd7b0ab6f3bef2920d60bfa791cbc25d63c251b2d72605db722c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜亂的聲音",
      "text": "救火！快救火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜亂的聲音",
      "text": "有刺客！保護陛下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜亂的聲音",
      "text": "衛兵，衛兵——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的守軍",
      "text": "清理火源，封鎖現場！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "小心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "這個火的來處……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "所有人！別碰杯子裡的酒！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "（是低溫火焰……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "（是何人……他想做什麼？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麟青硯試圖讓慌亂的人群冷靜下來，可她的聲音很快就被嘈雜的呼喊聲淹沒。\n在一片混亂中，她看到了一個熟悉的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只有一個眼神的交會，但麟青硯很清楚。\n那人看到了自己，看到了自己方才試圖當眾做出的出格舉動。\n但她的目標並不是自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "煌……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "吵什麼？怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "不好了！聽說百珍宴的會場不知道怎麼回事，突然起了一陣妖火！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "衛兵已經把會場全部圍起來了，不知道現在裡面什麼情況，也不知道陛下有沒有受傷……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資深廚師",
      "text": "他們說要……中斷百珍宴……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫不服",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "麟青硯……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衛兵A",
      "text": "我們收到消息，百珍宴混入了來歷不明的人，現在進行檢查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衛兵A",
      "text": "請所有人待在原地不要動，配合我們檢查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（該死……驚蟄那邊到底出什麼事了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（不行，不能把她丟在那裡……得去看看……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衛兵B",
      "text": "那邊的！不要走動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（怎麼辦怎麼辦，總不能在這裡打起來……）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（來不及了……！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衛兵B",
      "text": "那個人！追！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫長",
      "text": "一營、五營，封鎖南門入口；七營、九營，關閉北門！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫長",
      "text": "剩下的人，由南向北仔細檢查。一旦查到身分可疑的人，直接逮捕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "百夫長",
      "text": "情報說，破壞百珍宴的犯人至少為兩人一組共同作案，都小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "真要命，這麼多守軍……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "驚蟄啊驚蟄……你到底捅了多大的婁子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不過聽起來倒還沒有被抓起來……你到底在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嘖……這宮殿怎麼這麼大啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "怎麼是你？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "噓——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "你們不是要去找陛下申請翻案嗎？怎麼會搞成這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我也不知道啊，那把火可不是我們放的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "可是偏偏在這個時候……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "你還是趕快離開吧！要是被發現，就是有一百張嘴也說不清楚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我還要把麟青硯那個傢伙救出來呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "……讓我去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "這麼危險的事！怎麼能交給你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "禁城，我總比你熟悉一點，就算萬一被抓到了，也總有解釋的餘地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "放心吧，我會找到麟少卿的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "你還是信不過我，是還在生我的氣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "當然不——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "現在就往南門跑，趕在衛兵封鎖出口之前！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "……跑出去以後，我們還在那家飯館碰頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "……好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你也要小心……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "等一下，剛才有衛兵看到你的樣子了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "呃……應該是被看到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "這可不好辦了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "唉……對了！把你的衣服脫下來，換給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡邏的衛兵",
      "text": "我好像看到前面有人跑過去了！那邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "呼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "現場已經被清空了……麟少卿應該不在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "可是到底會是誰在百珍宴上做這種事……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "希望煌已經順利跑出去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……怎麼會是她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "這兩個孩子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……難道真有命數？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "似乎是不遠了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不知道她們那邊情況怎麼樣了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "……找到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "誰？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "原來就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嘶……好厲害的劍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你這身打扮，看起來和一般士兵不太一樣啊。難道你是什麼將軍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "休要多言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你就是麟青硯一直努力想要藏起來的人……可是她為什麼又要帶你來禁城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "呃……我知道擅闖別人的國宴確實是件不禮貌的事，可你願不願意相信，我們真的沒有惡意……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我要是說，這是個誤會……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "不會有什麼誤會，禁軍追查你的下落，已經有四十年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你是她的後人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你在說什麼？誰的後人？“她”是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你當真不知——\n不，看起來，你沒有說謊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你被保護起來這麼久，莫非從來沒有人和你說過你的身世？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哈哈，還真讓你說對了……我也很好奇我的身世，到底有沒有人能告訴我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可是，禁軍？找我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "四十年前，謀逆罪臣家中唯一一個下落不明的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你……說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "煌，我再確認一遍……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "你是1062年，在維多利亞出生的，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "對啊，從我記事起，我就是在維多利亞長大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "你父親生前，似乎花了很多年在追查一個真相……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "萬一……你發現，你周圍的一切，都是一個巨大的謊言……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "什……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "這都是什麼和什麼！*炎國粗口*閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你的身分特殊，如何處置須聽候審決。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "休想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "（呃——！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你的實力不弱，我沒有把握在不傷你的前提下將你拿住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "不想受傷的話，乖乖束手就擒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "開什麼玩笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "（沉重的喘息）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "我不是說過……出了事你先跑嗎……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "……麟青硯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "麟青硯看到了煌的眼神。\n她明白，她卻只能沉默。\n她轉過身，擋在了煌的身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "麟少卿，我敬重你在大理寺的名望，之前才好意提醒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "看來你終究是一點都沒有把我的警告放在心上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "我很清楚自己在做什麼，不用你提醒……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "你已經察覺到了她的身分，卻還要庇護這個罪臣的後人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "……為何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "為了真相……你們所有人都避而不談的真相。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "麟青硯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你們在說什麼……什麼叫……我是罪臣的後代？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我爸他……到底是什麼人，他又是為什麼死的……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "抱歉……本來打算今晚過後，就全部告訴你的。現在看起來實在不是個好時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "只要今天能活著離開這裡，之後你讓我怎麼道歉都行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "她今天必須跟我走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……有我在，你休想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“禁軍小教頭”",
      "text": "且不論贏過我，想要攔我，像你這樣的實力，得要三個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "麟青硯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "text": "……走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "驚雷在宮牆上炸開一個缺口，緊接著，又一道稍柔和的能量擊中了煌。\n她的身體飛出了這座禁城，向遙遠的地面墜去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煌曾無數次從高處躍下，跳入戰場中央，或是任何需要她的地方。\n她從不曾畏懼，她相信自己的力量，相信她的許多同伴。\n她也絕不迷茫，她很清楚自己是誰，也很清楚自己堅守的方向和信仰。\n沒有什麼陰謀伎倆能抵擋她的熱量，就像晨霧無法遮蔽太陽。\n……可現在呢？\n等待她的不再是一個堅實的地面，而是無盡的深淵。\n她閉上了眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧茵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寧茵氣若遊絲地躺在床上。\n老人拄著拐杖的手顫抖著，他幾欲摔倒。\n他已經活得夠久，見得夠多，他原本以為這世上已經不再有什麼能讓他失態的事。\n老人的嘴唇翕動著，但不論怎樣，他都沒能發出聲音。\n直到陰影中的人先開了口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "她還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "寧大人留步，不可再上前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "今晚你沒有見過我，她也沒有離開過家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "她……這是怎麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "她擅自闖入百珍宴，我發現她的時候，她正和那個孩子在一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果今天她遇上的是其他任何一個人，她斷然活不下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "竟然……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "四十年了……竟然還是你……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "四十年前，你把她留了下來，如今，又救她一命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "命……大抵是命吧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "……逃不過，到底逃不過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我留下她並非為了救她，救下她的，是寧大人才對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "寧大人曾立誓永遠不讓這樁舊案再被人知曉，才換來這個孩子的性命。如今看來，寧大人有食言之嫌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "今晚變故，真龍總會知曉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "選擇在寧大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣風起，彷彿什麼都沒有發生過。\n老人有些恍惚。\n可他聽到院牆外又傳來了一陣喧鬧。\n似是怒吼，似是哭訴，似是斥責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "真是昏了頭……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧述",
      "text": "這都秋天了……哪來的蟬鳴啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "這是……我怎麼在這裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "喲，醒啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "我就說你體格好肯定沒事，看，這不還活蹦亂跳的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "老姜還大驚小怪，非嚷嚷著要幫你找大夫，也不看看都幾點了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我暈過去多久了……她們在哪裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "麟青硯……寧茵她來過了嗎？我……怎麼會在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "別急別急，你一口氣問這麼多，我也不知道從哪開始回答啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "晚上的時候我本來想去晚市撿點便宜菜的，結果看見你就大咧咧地躺在路中央，我還以為你喝醉了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "我怕你冷到感冒，就順手把你撿回來囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "你睡得迷迷糊糊的，還罵人呢。罵這個偽君子，罵那個大騙子，還有好多……嘖嘖，都不知道你從哪裡學來這些炎國話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "你說的寧茵，還有叫麟青硯什麼的……沒見過，不清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我要去找她們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "欸欸，你上哪去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "……禁城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "我剛剛可看見外面都是巡邏衛兵，你覺得自己還進得去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我不管，那我也得去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "……把自己都弄丟了，你還想找誰啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你……你說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "我沒說錯啊，可不是把自己弄丟了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "不知道自己從哪來，想不通自己要上哪去，所以聽了別人三言兩語，連自己姓什麼叫什麼都搞不清，更不知道自己是誰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "謬矣，謬矣……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "一粒橘子的種子，被風從江南吹到了江北，落地生根，開花結果。讓種子變成桔子的，不是江南也不是江北，是這幾十年的陽光雨露。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "還是同樣一枚果子，江南江北的寫法雖不同，可果子還是這枚果子，不會有什麼變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "物有本末，事分名實……想通了這一點，才能再問別的一二三四啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你……知道什麼？你是不是知道什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我知道什麼？我就是一個煮飯的廚師，知道的不過是油鹽醬醋、煎煮炒炸這些——\n哦對，看見你我倒是想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "你不是一直要找那種味道正宗的桔紅酥嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小大廚",
      "text": "我好像，知道怎麼做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
